  "description": "Redis event outbox for Abblix Shared Signals: per-stream queues on Redis lists and hashes with atomic server-side operations, so an SSF transmitter stays correct when it runs as several replicas.",
  "iconFile": "Abblix.png",
  "id": "Abblix.SharedSignals.Redis",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-05T11:16:06Z",
